Description: GH-23240: extractTo() took a failed read (the CRC error of a corrupted entry) for success and wrote the corrupt data, and getFromName() and getFromIndex() never read up to the CRC check and returned such data silently; read errors fail with a warning now (PHP 8.4.26, not in this branch); brought onto 5.6 by hand (its safe_emalloc() buffer, n zip_int64_t); its tests not taken (PHP 7 and later)
Origin: php-src commit 2a2b337392a1e8d522026b3441360692db373192 (David Carlier, 13.08.2026, PHP 8.4.26)

